{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1469121-support-for-an-aberrant-war-official-supplement","id":1469121,"title":"Support for an Aberrant War official supplement","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-28T13:49:25-08:00","id":1469121,"title":"Support for an Aberrant War official supplement","content":"In a recent Onyx Path Podcast Episode 105 the Aberrant War was brought up. I see the point that the Aberrant War is so big that it should be left up to individual story tellers to describe. I think there is still room for an official supplement if there is interest from the fan community. A supplement wouldn't have to map out the war in detail to be useful to storytellers. Some things I'd like to see in such a supplement are:<ul><li>The goals and motivations of major individual players in the Aberrant universe during the war. (Divis Mal, Max Mercer, Anna Devries, Jeremiah Scripture, Count Raoul Orzaiz, Cestus Pax, Sophia Rousseau, etc.))</li> <li>What are possible roles for the major organizations in operation at the start of the war? (the Aeon Society,</li> <li>Project Utopia, Teragen, The Directive, the Elites, the Daedalus League, etc.)</li> <li>Some ideas on possible major events and confrontations that could be used as story hooks.</li> <li>How do baselines prosecute a war against Novas? What technology do they develop? How has Project Proteus been preparing for a possible Aberrant War? What baseline alliances are made?</li> </ul>What would you like to see from an official Aberrant War supplement?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25223-phdoom","name":"PhDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-28T17:04:39-08:00","id":1469133,"title":"","content":"I like this idea but if I ever ran Aberrant I would build up to the war over the course of months or even years of play, which means that my group\u2019s version of the Aberrant War might be very different from canon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-28T19:12:53-08:00","id":1469139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1469121-support-for-an-aberrant-war-official-supplement?p=1469133#post1469133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like this idea but if I ever ran Aberrant I would build up to the war over the course of months or even years of play, which means that my group\u2019s version of the Aberrant War might be very different from canon.</div> </div> </div> </div>well if they did it, I would hope it would be very much a toolkit for presenting it in different ways including different possible outcomes, not just a presentation of \u201chere are the canonical events in the timeline that leads to Anima and Aeon\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-28T20:42:06-08:00","id":1469145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PhDoom</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1469121-support-for-an-aberrant-war-official-supplement#post1469121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In a recent Onyx Path Podcast Episode 105</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, &quot;&quot;&quot;recent.&quot;&quot;&quot; That episode came out in May 2020.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-28T22:13:04-08:00","id":1469147,"title":"","content":"I would like to see a book telling the story from the aberrant point of view, for example, the Directive triggering Wicoff explosion in a tentative if put him down, or the Novas trying to to take control of Olympus as the only place they could avoid persecution (people end up starving not because of the Novas themselves, but because the governments stop supplying Olympus after the amovas took control of it).<br /> <br /> It would be an awesome counterpoint to the \u00c6on narrative of the war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T00:23:54-08:00","id":1469155,"title":"","content":"As some people have suggested, I think that the best option would be to show the aberrant war from different points of view and let the readers decide which version is the correct one, or maybe they all have some parts that are true and parts that are lies.<br /> I'm picturing a supplement written like an anthology, where different people from each of the alliances narrate the progress of the war from their perspective. The sequence of the events would be the same, but how they happened and why they happened would be different for each person. (I would really like to read Divis Mal thoughts as he saw his dreams crash spectacularly while stubbornly refusing to intervene because that would prove that Max was right)<br /> Another thing that I would like to see is a section about how the war was fought. How do the military deal with such a powerful and unpredictable enemy? How do the Novas organize themselves, or if they organize at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2964,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","user":"Firanai","date":". 11-29-2021, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T07:11:45-08:00","id":1469171,"title":"","content":"I think White Wolf did this back in the day for Gehenna/Apocalypse/Ascension War/etc... Of those books i managed to read i found their various takes on the subject interesting, the base narrative was always &quot;and things go to hell&quot; but the how/why was different for each even if the core elements of the &quot;hell&quot; had recurring elements (like The Withering to use the vampire example). In this case, the core element is always going to be humanity's xenophobia and nova disenfranchisement while they could outline various flavors of &quot;this is what broke the camel's back&quot; in a couple of scenarios.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T07:31:05-08:00","id":1469173,"title":"","content":"I add in my support of this supplement, with the caveat that I hope Onyx Path takes notes of what did/did not work from White Wolf's end-of-metaplot supplements. As others have already said, make it a grab-bag of ideas, setting points, relationship diagrams, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2176-spectaculartentacular","name":"SpectacularTentacular","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2176_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-29T09:08:49-08:00","id":1469175,"title":"","content":"Aberrant war book is not going to happen anytime soon, except for possible Community Content. AW is too big and there are too many aspects to be described, no matter what it is not going to be good for even half of the readers, because the expectations are just too diverse.<br /> <br /> what we may find is someone that have the courage to do some CC about it, what is not official, but I would love to read other people opinions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}